{"seq":4,"slug":"screenshot-testing","title":"截图测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/testing/screenshot-testing","wordCount":767,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"截图测试\">截图测试</h1><p>截图测试（Screenshot Testing）通过比较 UI 的像素级快照来检测视觉回归。它是确保 UI 一致性的有效手段，尤其适合设计系统、主题变更和跨设备适配等场景。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>截图测试围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Golden 文件基准</strong>：首次运行生成参考快照并存入 VCS，后续运行逐像素对比，差异即回归；预期变更时更新 Golden。</li>\n<li><strong>两种 JVM 方案</strong>：Paparazzi 用 layoutlib 纯 JVM 渲染、速度极快；Roborazzi 基于 Robolectric + Native Graphics，更接近真实设备且支持操作后截图。</li>\n<li><strong>CI 集成</strong>：PR 触发自动对比，失败时上传差异图供 Review，Golden 文件可用 Git / Git LFS / 远程存储管理。</li>\n<li><strong>设备矩阵</strong>：通过参数化测试覆盖不同屏幕尺寸与密度（小屏/标准/平板/折叠屏）。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"paparazzi\">Paparazzi</h2><p>Paparazzi 是 Square 出品的 JVM 截图测试框架，无需 Android 设备或模拟器即可运行，速度极快。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ProductCardSnapshotTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val paparazzi = Paparazzi(&#10;        deviceConfig = DeviceConfig.PIXEL_6,&#10;        theme = &quot;android:Theme.Material3.Light.NoActionBar&quot;&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun productCard_default() {&#10;        paparazzi.snapshot {&#10;            ProductCard(&#10;                product = Product(&#10;                    id = &quot;1&quot;,&#10;                    name = &quot;Kotlin 实战&quot;,&#10;                    price = 89.0,&#10;                    imageUrl = &quot;&quot;&#10;                ),&#10;                onClick = {}&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun productCard_outOfStock() {&#10;        paparazzi.snapshot {&#10;            ProductCard(&#10;                product = Product(&#10;                    id = &quot;2&quot;,&#10;                    name = &quot;缺货商品&quot;,&#10;                    price = 59.0,&#10;                    imageUrl = &quot;&quot;,&#10;                    inStock = false&#10;                ),&#10;                onClick = {}&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun loginScreen_allStates() {&#10;        paparazzi.snapshot(&quot;empty&quot;) {&#10;            LoginScreen(state = LoginState.Empty)&#10;        }&#10;        paparazzi.snapshot(&quot;loading&quot;) {&#10;            LoginScreen(state = LoginState.Loading)&#10;        }&#10;        paparazzi.snapshot(&quot;error&quot;) {&#10;            LoginScreen(state = LoginState.Error(&quot;用户名或密码错误&quot;))&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ProductCardSnapshotTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val paparazzi = Paparazzi(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        deviceConfig = DeviceConfig.PIXEL_6,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        theme = \"android:Theme.Material3.Light.NoActionBar\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun productCard_default() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        paparazzi.snapshot {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductCard(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                product = Product(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    id = \"1\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    name = \"Kotlin 实战\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    price = 89.0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    imageUrl = \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onClick = {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun productCard_outOfStock() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        paparazzi.snapshot {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductCard(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                product = Product(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    id = \"2\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    name = \"缺货商品\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    price = 59.0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    imageUrl = \"\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    inStock = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onClick = {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loginScreen_allStates() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        paparazzi.snapshot(\"empty\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            LoginScreen(state = LoginState.Empty)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        paparazzi.snapshot(\"loading\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            LoginScreen(state = LoginState.Loading)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        paparazzi.snapshot(\"error\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            LoginScreen(state = LoginState.Error(\"用户名或密码错误\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[编写截图测试] --&gt; B[首次运行: 生成 Golden 文件]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Golden 文件存入 VCS]&#10;    C --&gt; D[后续运行: 对比截图]&#10;    D --&gt; E{像素差异?}&#10;    E --&gt;|无差异| F[测试通过]&#10;    E --&gt;|有差异| G[测试失败]&#10;    G --&gt; H{是否预期变更?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[更新 Golden 文件]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[修复 UI 回归]&#10;    I --&gt; C&#10;&#10;    classDef decisionStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class E,H decisionStyle\">graph TD\n    A[编写截图测试] --&gt; B[首次运行: 生成 Golden 文件]\n    B --&gt; C[Golden 文件存入 VCS]\n    C --&gt; D[后续运行: 对比截图]\n    D --&gt; E{像素差异?}\n    E --&gt;|无差异| F[测试通过]\n    E --&gt;|有差异| G[测试失败]\n    G --&gt; H{是否预期变更?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[更新 Golden 文件]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[修复 UI 回归]\n    I --&gt; C\n\n    classDef decisionStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class E,H decisionStyle</pre><p>Paparazzi 的优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无需设备</td>\n<td>运行在 JVM 上，CI 友好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度快</td>\n<td>毫秒级截图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compose 支持</td>\n<td>原生支持 <code>@Composable</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多主题测试</td>\n<td>切换 Light/Dark 主题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多设备配置</td>\n<td>模拟不同屏幕尺寸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>./gradlew :app:recordPaparazziDebug</code> 录制 Golden 文件，<code>./gradlew :app:verifyPaparazziDebug</code> 验证截图。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"roborazzi\">Roborazzi</h2><p>Roborazzi 基于 Robolectric，在 JVM 上模拟 Android 环境运行截图测试，支持更接近真实设备的渲染。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@RunWith(ParameterizedRobolectricTestRunner::class)&#10;@GraphicsMode(GraphicsMode.Mode.NATIVE)&#10;@Config(sdk = [33])&#10;class ThemeSnapshotTest(&#10;    private val themeName: String,&#10;    private val isDarkTheme: Boolean&#10;) {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val composeRule = createComposeRule()&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val roborazziRule = RoborazziRule(&#10;        composeRule = composeRule,&#10;        captureRoot = composeRule.onRoot(),&#10;        options = RoborazziRule.Options(&#10;            outputDirectoryPath = &quot;src/test/snapshots&quot;&#10;        )&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    companion object {&#10;        @JvmStatic&#10;        @ParameterizedRobolectricTestRunner.Parameters(name = &quot;{0}&quot;)&#10;        fun params() = listOf(&#10;            arrayOf(&quot;light&quot;, false),&#10;            arrayOf(&quot;dark&quot;, true)&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun settingsScreen() {&#10;        composeRule.setContent {&#10;            MyAppTheme(darkTheme = isDarkTheme) {&#10;                SettingsScreen(&#10;                    settings = AppSettings(isDarkMode = isDarkTheme),&#10;                    onSettingsChange = {}&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        composeRule.onRoot().captureRoboImage(&#10;            &quot;settings_screen_$themeName.png&quot;&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@RunWith(RobolectricTestRunner::class)&#10;@GraphicsMode(GraphicsMode.Mode.NATIVE)&#10;class ComponentSnapshotTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val composeRule = createComposeRule()&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun buttonVariants() {&#10;        composeRule.setContent {&#10;            Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {&#10;                Button(onClick = {}) { Text(&quot;Primary&quot;) }&#10;                OutlinedButton(onClick = {}) { Text(&quot;Outlined&quot;) }&#10;                TextButton(onClick = {}) { Text(&quot;Text&quot;) }&#10;                FilledTonalButton(onClick = {}) { Text(&quot;Tonal&quot;) }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        composeRule.onRoot().captureRoboImage(&quot;button_variants.png&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@RunWith(ParameterizedRobolectricTestRunner::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@GraphicsMode(GraphicsMode.Mode.NATIVE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Config(sdk = [33])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ThemeSnapshotTest(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val themeName: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val isDarkTheme: Boolean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val composeRule = createComposeRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val roborazziRule = RoborazziRule(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule = composeRule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        captureRoot = composeRule.onRoot(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        options = RoborazziRule.Options(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            outputDirectoryPath = \"src/test/snapshots\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    companion object {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @JvmStatic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @ParameterizedRobolectricTestRunner.Parameters(name = \"{0}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fun params() = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            arrayOf(\"light\", false),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            arrayOf(\"dark\", true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun settingsScreen() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            MyAppTheme(darkTheme = isDarkTheme) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                SettingsScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    settings = AppSettings(isDarkMode = isDarkTheme),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    onSettingsChange = {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onRoot().captureRoboImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"settings_screen_$themeName.png\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@RunWith(RobolectricTestRunner::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@GraphicsMode(GraphicsMode.Mode.NATIVE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ComponentSnapshotTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val composeRule = createComposeRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun buttonVariants() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Button(onClick = {}) { Text(\"Primary\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                OutlinedButton(onClick = {}) { Text(\"Outlined\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                TextButton(onClick = {}) { Text(\"Text\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                FilledTonalButton(onClick = {}) { Text(\"Tonal\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onRoot().captureRoboImage(\"button_variants.png\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Paparazzi vs Roborazzi：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Paparazzi</th>\n<th>Roborazzi</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渲染引擎</td>\n<td>layoutlib（Android Studio 同款）</td>\n<td>Robolectric + Native Graphics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境</td>\n<td>纯 JVM</td>\n<td>JVM + Robolectric</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>快（Robolectric 初始化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实度</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>更高（更接近设备）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互支持</td>\n<td>仅静态截图</td>\n<td>支持操作后截图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compose 支持</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ci-集成\">CI 集成</h2><p>截图测试需要在 CI 中自动运行和管理 Golden 文件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions 配置示例&#10;name: Screenshot Tests&#10;on: [pull_request]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  screenshot-test:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Set up JDK 17&#10;        uses: actions/setup-java@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          java-version: &#39;17&#39;&#10;          distribution: &#39;temurin&#39;&#10;&#10;      - name: Run screenshot tests&#10;        run: ./gradlew verifyPaparazziDebug&#10;&#10;      - name: Upload failure diffs&#10;        if: failure()&#10;        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          name: screenshot-diffs&#10;          path: &#39;**/build/reports/paparazzi/&#39;&#10;          retention-days: 7\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions 配置示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Screenshot Tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  screenshot-test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Set up JDK 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-java@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          java-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'17'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          distribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'temurin'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run screenshot tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./gradlew verifyPaparazziDebug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Upload failure diffs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">failure()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/upload-artifact@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">screenshot-diffs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'**/build/reports/paparazzi/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          retention-days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[PR 提交] --&gt; B[CI 触发]&#10;    B --&gt; C[运行截图测试]&#10;    C --&gt; D{对比 Golden 文件}&#10;    D --&gt;|匹配| E[测试通过 ✓]&#10;    D --&gt;|不匹配| F[生成差异图]&#10;    F --&gt; G[上传 Artifact]&#10;    G --&gt; H[Review 差异]&#10;    H --&gt; I{预期变更?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[更新 Golden 并提交]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[修复代码]&#10;&#10;    classDef ciStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class B,C ciStyle\">graph TD\n    A[PR 提交] --&gt; B[CI 触发]\n    B --&gt; C[运行截图测试]\n    C --&gt; D{对比 Golden 文件}\n    D --&gt;|匹配| E[测试通过 ✓]\n    D --&gt;|不匹配| F[生成差异图]\n    F --&gt; G[上传 Artifact]\n    G --&gt; H[Review 差异]\n    H --&gt; I{预期变更?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[更新 Golden 并提交]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[修复代码]\n\n    classDef ciStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class B,C ciStyle</pre><p>CI 中管理 Golden 文件的策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存入 Git</td>\n<td>Golden 文件提交到仓库</td>\n<td>简单、可追溯</td>\n<td>增加仓库体积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Git LFS</td>\n<td>大文件存储</td>\n<td>不增加仓库体积</td>\n<td>需要 LFS 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远程存储</td>\n<td>存到 S3/GCS</td>\n<td>仓库轻量</td>\n<td>配置复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"golden-文件管理\">Golden 文件管理</h2><p>Golden 文件是截图测试的参考基准，需要规范化管理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"app/src/test/snapshots/&#10;├── images/&#10;│   ├── com.example.ProductCardSnapshotTest/&#10;│   │   ├── productCard_default.png&#10;│   │   ├── productCard_outOfStock.png&#10;│   │   └── productCard_darkTheme.png&#10;│   └── com.example.LoginScreenSnapshotTest/&#10;│       ├── loginScreen_empty.png&#10;│       ├── loginScreen_loading.png&#10;│       └── loginScreen_error.png\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app/src/test/snapshots/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── images/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── com.example.ProductCardSnapshotTest/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── productCard_default.png</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── productCard_outOfStock.png</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── productCard_darkTheme.png</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── com.example.LoginScreenSnapshotTest/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── loginScreen_empty.png</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── loginScreen_loading.png</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── loginScreen_error.png</span></span></code></pre></div><p>更新 Golden 文件的工作流：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 录制新的 Golden 文件&#10;./gradlew :app:recordPaparazziDebug&#10;&#10;# 验证当前 UI 与 Golden 文件一致&#10;./gradlew :app:verifyPaparazziDebug&#10;&#10;# 查看差异报告&#10;open app/build/reports/paparazzi/index.html\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 录制新的 Golden 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :app:recordPaparazziDebug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证当前 UI 与 Golden 文件一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :app:verifyPaparazziDebug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看差异报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">open</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app/build/reports/paparazzi/index.html</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 PR 中更新 Golden 文件时，建议使用单独的提交，方便 Reviewer 区分代码变更和截图变更。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"设备矩阵\">设备矩阵</h2><p>通过多设备配置测试不同屏幕尺寸和密度的适配效果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@RunWith(ParameterizedRobolectricTestRunner::class)&#10;class DeviceMatrixTest(&#10;    private val deviceName: String,&#10;    private val deviceConfig: DeviceConfig&#10;) {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val paparazzi = Paparazzi(deviceConfig = deviceConfig)&#10;&#10;    companion object {&#10;        @JvmStatic&#10;        @ParameterizedRobolectricTestRunner.Parameters(name = &quot;{0}&quot;)&#10;        fun devices() = listOf(&#10;            arrayOf(&quot;phone_small&quot;, DeviceConfig.NEXUS_5),&#10;            arrayOf(&quot;phone_large&quot;, DeviceConfig.PIXEL_6_PRO),&#10;            arrayOf(&quot;tablet&quot;, DeviceConfig.PIXEL_C),&#10;            arrayOf(&quot;foldable&quot;, DeviceConfig.PIXEL_FOLD)&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun homeScreen_adaptsToDevice() {&#10;        paparazzi.snapshot(&quot;home_$deviceName&quot;) {&#10;            HomeScreen(state = HomeUiState.sample())&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@RunWith(ParameterizedRobolectricTestRunner::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class DeviceMatrixTest(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val deviceName: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val deviceConfig: DeviceConfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val paparazzi = Paparazzi(deviceConfig = deviceConfig)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    companion object {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @JvmStatic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @ParameterizedRobolectricTestRunner.Parameters(name = \"{0}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fun devices() = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            arrayOf(\"phone_small\", DeviceConfig.NEXUS_5),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            arrayOf(\"phone_large\", DeviceConfig.PIXEL_6_PRO),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            arrayOf(\"tablet\", DeviceConfig.PIXEL_C),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            arrayOf(\"foldable\", DeviceConfig.PIXEL_FOLD)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun homeScreen_adaptsToDevice() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        paparazzi.snapshot(\"home_$deviceName\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            HomeScreen(state = HomeUiState.sample())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备配置</th>\n<th>屏幕宽度</th>\n<th>密度</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>NEXUS_5</code></td>\n<td>360dp</td>\n<td>xxhdpi</td>\n<td>小屏手机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PIXEL_6</code></td>\n<td>411dp</td>\n<td>xxhdpi</td>\n<td>标准手机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PIXEL_6_PRO</code></td>\n<td>411dp</td>\n<td>xxxhdpi</td>\n<td>大屏手机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PIXEL_C</code></td>\n<td>900dp</td>\n<td>xhdpi</td>\n<td>平板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PIXEL_FOLD</code></td>\n<td>841dp</td>\n<td>xxhdpi</td>\n<td>折叠屏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Paparazzi 在 JVM 上运行截图测试，无需设备，速度极快，CI 友好</li>\n<li>Roborazzi 基于 Robolectric 渲染，支持交互后截图，更接近真实设备</li>\n<li>CI 集成通过自动对比 Golden 文件检测视觉回归，失败时上传差异图</li>\n<li>Golden 文件存入 Git 仓库管理，更新时使用独立提交便于 Review</li>\n<li>设备矩阵通过参数化测试覆盖多种屏幕尺寸和密度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"截图测试","id":"截图测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Paparazzi","id":"paparazzi"},{"level":2,"text":"Roborazzi","id":"roborazzi"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 集成","id":"ci-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Golden 文件管理","id":"golden-文件管理"},{"level":2,"text":"设备矩阵","id":"设备矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Espresso UI 测试框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/testing/espresso"},"next":null}